{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/3368","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/3368/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/3368/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/3368/events","html_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/issues/3368","id":413397576,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0MTMzOTc1NzY=","number":3368,"title":"Properties, maps and each. Trying to generate CSS custom properties","user":{"login":"lostkeys","id":3122929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjI5Mjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3122929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys","html_url":"https://github.com/lostkeys","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostkeys/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2103265,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTAzMjY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"e10c02","default":true,"description":null},{"id":43298739,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MzI5ODczOQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/needs%20decision","name":"needs decision","color":"a319e7","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2019-02-22T13:11:13Z","updated_at":"2020-07-29T00:23:29Z","closed_at":"2020-07-29T00:23:29Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"So I'm trying to combine the power of preprocessing with the versatility of CSS Custom Properties. The use case is a theming tool where Less is used to generate the base styles and user tweaks can be handled in the browser.\r\n\r\n```less\r\n@vars: {\r\n  background-color: black;\r\n  color: contrast($background-color, #000, #fff);\r\n}\r\n  \r\n:root {\r\n  each(@vars, {\r\n    --@{key}: @value;\r\n  });\r\n}\r\n\r\ndiv {\r\n  display: inline-block;\r\n  padding: 1rem;\r\n  background-color: var(--background-color);\r\n  color: var(--color);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever this example breaks with the each loop returning the following error `error evaluating function each: Property '$background-color' is undefined`. I kind of understand why this is happening though. Do someone know of a different way to solve this?\r\n\r\nHere is a [Codepen demo](https://codepen.io/fredde/pen/rPEJBv?editors=1100#0)","closed_by":{"login":"matthew-dean","id":414752,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNDc1Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/414752?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthew-dean","html_url":"https://github.com/matthew-dean","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthew-dean/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthew-dean/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthew-dean/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthew-dean/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthew-dean/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthew-dean/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matth